From: Djair Guilherme <djair.jr@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] osdrv: port the Sophgo multimedia modules to Linux 7.2

Vendor osdrv/interdrv (cv181x) built out of tree for 7.2. Grows step by
step with the modules of F7 (docs/multimedia.md); every change is
marked with a "7.2 port" comment. Modules: sys, base, snsr_i2c, cif
(cvi_mipi_rx), vi, vpss, vcodec, jpeg, cvi_vc_drv (cvi_vc_driver), tpu.

